00:01:02.540 --> 00:01:06.079
The first time he mentioned that it was people
who were telling him this.

00:01:06.079 --> 00:01:09.180
The second time Trump told the story verbatim.

00:01:09.180 --> 00:01:13.200
He said it was big Republican donor, Sheldon
Adelson who told them this.

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:17.580
Then the third time he told a story, it was
the owner of the new England Patriots, NFL

00:01:17.580 --> 00:01:20.610
